%% A message to itself on the last participant, notes wider than their participant
%% expect: participants=2 messages=3 notes=2
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Client
    participant B as Server
    A->>B: request
    B->>B: validate the request and its signature
    Note over A: a note much wider than its participant
    Note right of B: on the right edge
    B-->>A: response
